  {
   "id": "BUG 112",
   "desc": "compile_circuit: unknown behavior silently compiled as 'sensor' architecture while reporting the caller's behavior label; circuit_report('AND') paired an AND architecture with the repressilator simulation. Fix: ValueError on unknown behavior."
  },
  {
   "id": "BUG 113",
   "desc": "gillespie_expression: ZeroDivisionError when no reactions possible at initial state (transcription=0, no molecules); duration<=0 produced nan noise_cv with RuntimeWarnings on an empty trace. Fix: input validation."
  },
  {
   "id": "BUG 114",
   "desc": "simulate_oscillator reported transient-dominated amplitude/peak_count as if sustained: at defaults the repressilator is damped (first-quarter amplitude 1.36 vs last-quarter 0.40). Fix: report per-quarter amplitudes, sustained_oscillation flag and dynamics_note."
  }
 ],
